No.		Action item 			System
A. Supplier Evaluation App (Power Apps)					
1	Open the Supplier Evaluation App link with the required Section parameter.	Power Apps
2	Click Start to begin the Supplier Evaluation process and load the evaluation.	Power Apps
3	Complete Answer 1: Evaluation Sheet for Suppliers.	Power Apps
4	Click Next (all required questions must be answered before proceeding).		Power Apps
5	If the evaluation is incomplete, display message: "Please answer the evaluation before proceeding."	Power Apps
6	Answer 2: Evaluation Method (Optional).		Power Apps
7	Click Submit to save and submit the completed Supplier Evaluation form		Power Apps
8	Upon successful submission, display message: "Your form has been submitted successfully."	Power Apps
9	If the evaluation was previously submitted for the current year, display message: "Your evaluation for this year has already been submitted."		Power Apps

B. Supplier Evaluation Macro (Excel VBA Macro)					
1	Click Update Summary button to initiate the summary update process.	Excel VBA Macro
2	Refresh the SE Evaluation List sheet.		Excel VBA Macro
3	Update the Supplier Periodic Evaluation Summary Template using the latest supplier evaluation records.	Excel VBA Macro
4	Display pop-up message box: "File updated successfully.".	Excel VBA Macro
